@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix demo: <https://demo.example/> .

# Publisher A's vocabulary for the same real thing.
<https://a.example/bobbin-release> a demo:Release ; rdfs:label "bobbin-release" .
<https://a.example/skein-release>  a demo:Release ; rdfs:label "skein-release" .
